--- expect error: branch-merge retained validation key bytes

--- query
query docs_after_refusal() { match { $d: Doc } return { count($d) as n } }
--- expect unordered
{"n": 1}
--- expect shape
n: I64

--- mutate
branch create stage from commit "${first_row}"
--- expect ok

--- mutate
branch merge stage into main
--- expect outcome: merged

--- mutate
branch merge b0 into main
--- expect outcome: merged

--- query
query docs_after_stages() { match { $d: Doc } return { count($d) as n } }
--- expect unordered
{"n": 4}
--- expect shape
n: I64
